---
---
<div>
	<h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-ink mb-2">One pattern, one rep, most weeks.</h2>
	<p class="text-muted measure mb-4">
		A short piece on a recurring leadership pattern, the belief underneath it, and one
		specific thing to do about it. No course launches, no funnel. Unsubscribe whenever.
	</p>
	<form action="#" method="post" class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 items-end max-w-md">
		<div class="flex-1 min-w-[200px]">
			<label for="newsletter-email" class="eyebrow block mb-1 text-muted">Email address</label>
			<input
				id="newsletter-email"
				name="email"
				type="email"
				required
				class="w-full border border-rule rounded-[3px] bg-surface px-3 py-2 text-ink focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-petrol"
			/>
		</div>
		<button
			type="submit"
			class="bg-petrol text-paper px-4 py-2 rounded-[3px] font-medium hover:opacity-90 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-petrol"
		>
			Subscribe
		</button>
	</form>
	<p class="text-xs text-muted mt-2">
		[CONFIRM: email provider — Kit / Beehiiv / Buttondown. Form action URL goes here.]
	</p>
</div>
